== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Troll Shaman, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Give note Kaglari. . .Kaglari pretty. . .Kaglari learn you majik. . .make you powerful.

Upon handing the note to [[Kaglari]]:

: [[Kaglari]] says, 'Good.. Kaglari need you help.. Kaglari teach you majik now.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Ones]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Shadowknights of Night Keep]] got better.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Muck Stained Tunic*]]. Good luck, Shaman!

